{#
  ntldd (Need To Link Dependency Display) Configuration
  -----------------------------------------------------
  ntldd is a diagnostic utility that displays the shared libraries
  required by ELF binaries. It does not have a persistent configuration
  file or service daemon.
  
  This package template represents a placeholder for a potential
  global configuration, as ntldd typically operates on a per-command
  basis. No runtime configuration directives are emitted.
#}
# ntldd configuration is not supported in this version.
# Use 'ntldd <binary>' directly to inspect dependencies.